  ⛔⛔⛔ A STIPULATION, NOT A FILING. See assets/fixtures/README.md. Nothing here was observed
  and nothing here may be cited as evidence about any business.

  ⭐⭐⭐ THE STATE THIS EXISTS FOR IS A CYCLE IN THE UNIT GRAPH, WHICH NO DOCUMENT COULD CLOSE
  BEFORE. A conversion runs from a part layer's unit to the composed layer's unit and carries
  `asrt:Part/factor`. Read that way every fusion is an EDGE between two units, and the whole
  corpus is a graph. `merge-holding-composition` files the only edge there was, GPU to
  GPU-hour at [672, 720, 744]. Two more close a cycle:

      GPU  =[672, 720, 744]=>  GPU-hour  =0.125=>  node-hour  =[.0108,.0112,.0116]=>  GPU

  ⛔⛔ AND THE CYCLE IS IN THE UNIT GRAPH, NEVER IN THE PART GRAPH. Parts are a DAG and two
  rules exist to keep them one, `local_cycle` and `leaf_reached_twice`. The three layers below
  form a chain, reserved-hours then node-capacity then cards, and nothing is composed
  from itself. It is the UNITS that come back round.

  ⭐⭐ WHAT THE CYCLE IS WORTH, AND IT IS NOT AN EQUALITY. Multiply the three:

      low     672 x 0.125 x 0.0108  =  0.9072
      mode    720 x 0.125 x 0.0112  =  1.008
      high    744 x 0.125 x 0.0116  =  1.0788

  One lies inside, and the product is not one. ⛔ IT CANNOT BE. A cycle through this graph
  passes through 720, and 720 = 2^4 x 3^2 x 5. A terminating decimal has only twos and fives
  under the line, so no pair of filable decimals multiplies to 1/720 and no document can make
  these modes close exactly. The law a receiver can hold this to is CONTAINMENT: one lies
  inside the product interval.

  ⚠️⚠️ AND THE WIDTH IS NOT MEASUREMENT ERROR, IT IS THE DEPENDENCY PROBLEM AGAIN. The month
  that turns cards into card-hours is the SAME month that turns node-hours back into cards.
  Interval arithmetic multiplies them as two independent months and spans nine per cent either
  way; a receiver who knew they were one month would get exactly one. That is the third site
  in this repository where treating correlated quantities as independent widens a bound past
  what the filer knows. See `merge-holding-composition/compute`'s shares, and the composed
  remainder beside them.

  ⭐ The two exactness classes are filed side by side ON PURPOSE. Eight cards to a chassis is
  countable, so that factor is a point. A month is not one number, so the other has width, for
  the reason merge-holding-composition gives about its own.
-->
